13
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.520 align:middle
<c.cyan>Der Moderator</c>
<c.cyan>und Blogger Raul Krauthausen.</c>

14
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.280 align:middle
<c.cyan>Die Journalistin und Buchautorin</c>
<c.cyan>Nena Brockhaus.</c>

15
00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.640 align:middle
<c.cyan>Einen wunderschönen guten Abend.</c>

16
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:01.960 align:middle
